HV075,"The story of the family headquarters for the return of the kidnapped and missing - diplomacy and international missions The international department led one of the largest and most significant international moves in the history of the State of Israel. The department included hundreds of employees and volunteers, among them diplomats, former ambassadors, former MKs, academics and media, and field staffs in 50 countries. As part of the international diplomatic and legal work, hundreds of delegations of families of abductees and survivors of captivity went out, mainly to the USA and key European countries, with the aim of making their voices heard and influencing policy. Members of the families met with presidents, prime ministers, foreign ministers, elected officials and officials Key in the international arena, and reached the decision-making centers in Washington, New York, London, Berlin, Paris, Brussels, Geneva and The Hague. Each delegation was accompanied by extensive communication, careful logistical planning and close coordination in Israel and abroad. the lives and the spaces, and changed the public discourse in the country. The peak of the effort was recorded in the meetings held by President Trump with the survivors of the captivity and the family members and in the speeches given by the special envoy Witkoff, Trump's son-in-law Kushner and his daughter Ivanka in the Kidnapped Square in front of half a million participants.  Along with the many trips, many meetings of the families of the abductees and the returnees with diplomats and government officials from dozens of countries around the world were held at the headquarters and in the square.   Photographs (credit Eyal Radoshinsky, Lior Rothstein, headquarters of the families of the abductees): 11.19.2023 - The establishment of the international coalition on the subject of the abductees 12.2023 - About a week after the release of the survivor of the captivity Sharon Aloni-Kunio, a meeting at the headquarters of the families with the head - FDI. 5.2024 - preparatory meeting for Pompeo's visit to Israel. 1.9.2024 - Ambassadors light memorial candles at the headquarters of the families for the six abductees who were murdered in the tunnels in Gaza.  Bring Them Home Now by [USER] A [USER] project - Other backups: [USER]",,,,,,
