HV205,"Kyivstar and Povarnys zhivym completed the collection for the Mission 077 army. In 5 months, the project collected UAH 77 million for the four army corps that hold the northern border.  In particular, UAH 20 million is a charitable contribution of the Kyivstar company. The rest of the funds were donated by subscribers, as well as caring and socially responsible businesses. Among the companies that joined the initiative: 1+1 Media, ANC Pharmacy Network, Milk Bar, Uklon, theater named after Franca, Portmone and others.   As part of the project, there have already been two deliveries of property to the military. They received interactive panels, charging stations, satellite systems, wired phones, tablets and other equipment on which continuous communication in units depends. Within the framework of the last, third edition, which will take place in the near future, pickup trucks and beads will be handed over for fast logistics.  In total, over four years, Kyivstar allocated almost UAH 4.4 billion to help the country, the Armed Forces, society and subscribers.  💶💶💶💶💶💶💶 [USER]",,,,,,
